n\n- Merge pull request #390 from Dengnifer/issue-369-averaged-extended-point-consistency\n- Merge commit '51f49fa47e8118483f541f8354189e7460a54b83' into issue-369-averaged-extended-point-consistency\n- chore(telemetry): GitHub record snapshot\n- chore(telemetry): record PR372 integration\n- Merge pull request #372 from Dengnifer/issue-367-combine-line-polynomial-proofs\n- Merge released main into axis parameter defect transport\n- Merge branch 'main' into issue-367-combine-line-polynomial-proofs\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): recover combined point witness\n- chore(telemetry): GitHub record snapshot\n- chore(telemetry): record PR371 integration\n- Merge pull request #371 from Dengnifer/issue-366-resume-native-review-publication\n- Merge restricted seed mass prerequisite\n- Merge branch 'main' into issue-366-resume-native-review-publication\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): prove restricted line mixture bounds\n- fix(review): address native resume findings\n- chore(telemetry): GitHub record snapshot\n- chore(telemetry): record PR319 integration\n- Merge pull request #319 from Dengnifer/issue-316-direct-coefficient-collision\n- fix(QPBT/Combining): Prove restricted seed mass\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): prove combined polynomial degree bound\n- Merge frozen main into direct coefficient collision\n- fix(QPBT/Combining): prove line polynomial bounds\n- Merge branch 'main' into issue-366-resume-native-review-publication\n- fix(local): resume completed native review publication\n- Merge commit '1785520949014bcc37684684e412b713712ef0f6' into issue-351-axis-parameter-defect-transport\n- fix(review): classify coefficient collision lemma\n- Merge frozen main into direct coefficient collision\n- Merge commit 'af87d3f2f5787ea3fea793260f995ea93f47ba85' into issue-351-axis-parameter-defect-transport\n- feat(QPBT/Combining): identify axis parameter defects\n- Merge final frozen main into direct coefficient collision\n- Merge commit '04f446ba02c09ab596a9940ffd3ba9909d4b7090' into issue-351-axis-para